{"title":"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each of the letters <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/7/6f72bafb29c6f143901be25459b3984ed3fb2671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{W}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/e/4ae5f1c3bb5ee22198c136ad4cc3dda97286f0d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{X}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/f/fcfb65d98e3e4d7d8592056f225e7e1bddebf4d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/0/1007df3907ac8012f2fda920cd57d95b80bb2fb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"13\" /> represents a different integer in the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/c/e5c98d8a23bd725ef1991c6503d9775ab3cb06a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{ 1,2,3,4\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" />, but not necessarily in that order.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/0/c300d14ef373ab594139a9940a80fe96f93272ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{\\text{W}}{\\text{X}} - \\dfrac{\\text{Y}}{\\text{Z}}=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"37\" />, then the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/7/6f72bafb29c6f143901be25459b3984ed3fb2671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{W}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/f/fcfb65d98e3e4d7d8592056f225e7e1bddebf4d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{Y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/6/dc62436e1612a55d60f6bc202adeebdda890a399.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are different ways to approach this problem, and I'll start with the different factor of the numbers of the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/c/e5c98d8a23bd725ef1991c6503d9775ab3cb06a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{ 1,2,3,4\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> has factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> has factors <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> has factors <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> has factors <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>From here, we note that even though all numbers have the factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> has another factor other than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the set (ie. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />)\n</p><p>We could therefore have one fraction be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/b/89b4a55f1a250bb103ef961e9b0a215d192621fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> and another <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/1/2d1296c778aa681d1c3f75673e504426d178d66a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"11\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>The sum of the numerators is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/d/d4de46feb8b95c0afb474bb62d0fb3a6f7c9dee4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4+3=7=\\boxed{E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME\" title=\"1998 AJHSME\">1998 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1998\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1998 AJHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AJHSME\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AJHSME\">AJHSME</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AJHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AJHSME Problems and Solutions\">